                "loc": "EXO.37.17+EXO.37.18+EXO.37.19+EXO.37.20+EXO.37.21+EXO.37.22+EXO.37.23+EXO.37.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "37.17-24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot owaco ki Moses ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wac bot Aron ni, Ka icibo laput malo, laput abiro-ni bimenyo kabedo ma i nyim okar-mac.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Aron otimo kit meno; ocibo mac laputte malo wek gumeny kabedo ma i nyim okarmac, macalo Rwot ociko ki Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man aye kit tic ma gitiyo kwede okar-mac, gitiyo ki jabu ma giteto ki nyol. Nia ki i tedi tere o kwede wa i kom cal aturene onoŋo gitiyo kun giteto ki nyol; Moses otiyo okar-mac kun lubo kit cal ma Rwot onoŋo onyuto bote.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot owaco ki Moses ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwany Lulevi woko ki i kin jo Icrael, ci ilonygi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibitimogi kit man pi lonyogi: kir pii me lwoko bal i komgi, ci wek gin gulyel komgi woko ducu ki lyedi, gulwok boŋŋigi, gulonnye kekengi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen wek gin gukwany wod twon kacel ki gityer me moko kwon mutike, me moko kwon mapwote ma girubo ki moo, ka doki in ibikwanyo wod twon mukene pi gitum me bal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka doŋ ibitero Lulevi i nyim kema me rwatte, kun icoko lwak jo Icrael ducu kacel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka itero Lulevi i nyim Rwot, jo Icrael gibiketo ciŋgi i wigi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka Aron bityero Lulevi i nyim Rwot gubed gityer akwata ma oa ki bot jo Icrael, wek gubed ka tiyo tic pa Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok Lulevi gibiketo ciŋgi i wi twoni, ci ibityero acel pi gitum me bal, ki acel pi gitum awaŋa bot Rwot, pi kwanyo bal ki i kom Lulevi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibitero Lulevi i nyim Aron ki awo bene, ci ibityerogi gubed gityer akwata bot Rwot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ibipoko Lulevi woko ki i kin jo Icrael kit meno, ci Lulevi doŋ bibedo jona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka doŋ lacen Lulevi gibidonyo ka tiyo tic ma i kema me rwatte, ka doŋ ityeko lonyogi kun ityerogi macalo gityer akwata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien gityeko miyogi bota matwal ki i kin jo Icrael; atyeko kwanyogi pira kena ma ka litino ducu mukwoŋo yabo ic, ma litino kayo pa jo Icrael ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nia 13.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien litino kayo ducu ma i kin jo Icrael gin mera, pa dano ki pa lee bene; yam akwerogi gubed mera i nino ma aneko iye litino kayo ducu ma i lobo Ejipt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci doŋ atyeko kwanyo jo pa Levi me leyo ka tyengi, gin litino kayo ducu ma i kin jo Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok atyeko miyo Lulevi bot Aron ki awobene me mot, kun gia woko ki i kin jo Icrael pi tiyo tic i kema me rwatte pi jo Icrael, dok pi kwanyo bal ki i kom jo Icrael, wek gemo mo pe opot i kom jo Icrael pi nyiko cok ki kabedo maleŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses ki Aron ki lwak jo Icrael ducu gutiyo kit meno i kom Lulevi; kit ducu ma yam Rwot ociko ki Moses i kom Lulevi-ni, jo Icrael bene gutimo i komgi kit meno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lulevi gulonnye kekengi i kom balgi; gulwoko boŋŋigi; ka Aron otyerogi macalo gityer akwata i nyim Rwot, ci Aron otimo gin lakwany bal ki i komgi wek gubed ma gulony.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen Lulevi gudonyo ka tiyo ticgi i kema me rwatte me konyo Aron ki awobene; kit ma onoŋo Rwot ociko ki Moses i kom Lulevi, gitimogi kit meno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot owaco ki Moses ni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Man aye lok ma mako Lulevi: jo ma ditogi romo mwaka pyeraryo wiye abic ki dok kwede malo gibidonyo ka cobo dog ticgi ma gitiyo pi kema me rwatte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka mwaka me ditogi oromo pyerabic, ci doŋ gibiweko ticgi ma gitiyo, pe doŋ gibitic matwal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento gibikonyo omegigi ma i kema me rwatte wek gugwok cik ma mako ticgi, ento pe gibitiyo tic kikome. Ibitimo Lulevi kit meno pi lok ma dok i kom ticgi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
